>  #define RDMA0_MOUT_DSI3			0x5
>  #define RDMA1_MOUT_DPI0			0x2
> +#define RDMA1_MOUT_DPI1			0x3

Usually, each bit of a mout register represent a output enable. Is this
value 0x3 a correct value?

Regards,
CK

